00:17:47.530 --> 00:17:51.160
And like Bill Hippenmeyer,
I'm not a hero in coding.

00:17:51.160 --> 00:17:52.980
I'm not a hero in
spreadsheet management.

00:17:52.980 --> 00:17:55.510
So they simply designed
