analyze big chunks of data

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:19.010
without me being an expert.

00:18:19.010 --> 00:18:22.280
Can we go back to
the presentation?

00:18:22.280 --> 00:18:23.090
And that helps.

00:18:23.090 --> 00:18:25.330
It allows you to be
productive throughout the day.

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:27.610
We don't need special
