that we have implemented

00:18:54.010 --> 00:18:56.350
in our products at first.

00:18:56.350 --> 00:18:58.150
So the moment that
you use Google,

00:18:58.150 --> 00:19:00.970
we enable you to search
through all the documents

00:19:00.970 --> 00:19:03.070
like you are used to
from Google, right?

00:19:03.070 --> 00:19:04.690
So it's optimal
character recognition.

00:19:04.690 --> 00:19:07.120
You are able to find the
documents much faster than you

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:09.160
were used to.

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:11.620
In seconds you'll have all
the relevant information.

00:19:11.620 --> 00:19:14.140
Not just that, we're going to
base it on the context base,

00:19:14.140 --> 00:19:17.440
on the device you're using based
on your next calendar entry

00:19:17.440 --> 00:19:20.530
we're going to deliver
you the documents that

00:19:20.530 --> 00:19:21.800
are relevant for you, right.

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:24.460
So the moment that you
have a calendar entry which

00:19:24.460 --> 00:19:27.220
your colleague is going to
get all the documents that you

00:19:27.220 --> 00:19:29.200
recently shared with
that specific colleague,

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:31.069
it's going to present
it to you immediately.

00:19:31.069 --> 00:19:32.860
And that's going to
save you a lot of time,

00:19:32.860 --> 00:19:37.360
and get you a lot of more
value out of your work.

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:40.240
And that's called
Google Cloud Search.

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:44.530
So it's going to improve
your productivity massively.

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:48.730
And this is the last one I want
to share with you on the Drive,

00:19:48.730 --> 00:19:50.410
