knowing what to do.

00:30:47.470 --> 00:30:49.870
Set good guidelines.

00:30:49.870 --> 00:30:51.040
Do some proper planning.

00:30:51.040 --> 00:30:53.040
Take your time for it.

00:30:53.040 --> 00:30:56.260
Another-- well, I think
the most crucial factor

00:30:56.260 --> 00:30:58.210
was our Google heroes.

00:30:58.210 --> 00:31:03.730
So there we didn't
select people.

00:31:03.730 --> 00:31:07.690
We just asked for who
wants to voluntarily apply

00:31:07.690 --> 00:31:09.850
