a new way of working,

00:31:26.150 --> 00:31:31.030
a new tool set, which is
I think a crucial factor

00:31:31.030 --> 00:31:34.690
in the success of having
a successful change.

00:31:34.690 --> 00:31:36.850
Additionally, give
a lot of attention

00:31:36.850 --> 00:31:39.640
